<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 266.98 mln rand S.Africa bonds Fri.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 266.98 mln rand S.Africa bonds Fri.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 266.98 million rand worth of South African bonds on Friday after selling 21.36 million rand the previous day, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
